{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>今日，英偉達官方發文慶祝GeForce GTX 10系列發佈10周年。英偉達GTX 10系列GPU基於Pascal架構，於2016年正式推出。在官方公眾號發佈的文章中，英偉達分享了2016年那些難忘遊戲的高光時刻，包括《戰地1》、《黑暗之魂3》、《恥辱2》、《毀滅戰士 (2016)》、《守望先鋒》、《泰坦隕落2》和《巫師3：狂獵-血與酒》。</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_566906_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>英偉達表示GeForce GTX 1080搭載16nm Pascal架構，擁有72億個電晶體、GDDR5X高速顯存，並推出了採用全鋁外殼和真空腔均熱板散熱設計的Founders Edition公版顯卡。</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_620308.webp\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_437557.webp\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_165401.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778161137_108391.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_917950_png_r.webp\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>視頻畫面：</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_575682_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_167244_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_111255_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_432577_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_968772_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160923_937246_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160924_753857_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160924_851590_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260507/1778160924_505383_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"生日快樂！GeForce GTX 1080迎來10周歲\">\n    </p>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T15:13:10.704088+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":15,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}